Rule 3 (output index dtype must be int32 or int64)
{v_2 : dtype} |= v_2 = 3 ∨ v_2 = 4
>>
Rule 4 (matrix dimensions must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (batch dimensions, if any, have non-negative sizes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0 else 0 = 0
